{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"GEMの舞彩と対談したよ～プライベートでもほんっと仲良しだから一緒に仕事出来て嬉しかった♡EX大衆！９月15日発売！見てねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして！真夏の全国ツアー2015ついに千秋楽を迎えることができましたぁ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場では沢山の団扇やタオル、Tシャツも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見つけましたー！（≧∇≦）\nそしてロビーには素敵なお花もありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花にメッセージも書いてくれてたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました‼︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"17才の夏は乃木坂一色でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46でなければできない経験が沢山できて凄く自分にとって刺激的な日々を過ごしていて、、この夏はもう全部休む間もなく乃木坂でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもこうして全国各地をまわって沢山のファンのみんなの笑顔が見れて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー全員で無事に千秋楽を迎えられて良かった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかね  自分の中で思うことも沢山あって、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーやスタッフさん、そしてファンの皆様の大切さ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言葉や文章には書ききれないぐらいの\nあふれる気持ちがあって...\nなんて伝えたらいいんだろう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうだけじゃ伝えきれない思いが自分の中であふれた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやが知らないうちに みんなが育ててくれてる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"う～ん    やっぱりありがとうって言葉がいっぱい出てくるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に\nありがとう！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー、スタッフさん、ファンのみんなが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなだいすきぃぃぃっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして乃木坂に兼任として携わってくれた松井玲奈さん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中継で豊田スタジアムを見た時\n玲奈さんのパフォーマンスを久しぶりに見てやっぱりすごいなぁと圧倒されました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に尊敬するところだらけで大好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また遊びに来てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お疲れ様でした♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドラマも良かったよ～っていうコメントいただけて嬉しいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めての不良役！そして初めてのエクステでメッシュ？も入れて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか悪い子になった気分でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"演技も好評でよかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブの動画を見ながらうるうるしているまあやより"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体調崩してないですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もみんなが笑顔でありますように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントや755で応援してくれてありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までよりもっと成長した姿を見せるから！ついてこいよっ♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとずっと夢だったアンダーライブがついに武道館LIVE決定しました！！！！\nほんとに嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見ていてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0020.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}